{"firma": "40eb5db972e3f294de29ce613fc9547cf235cdcd", "file": "text.hsp", "riga": 2911, "occorrenza": 0, "jp": "谷の奥に街道が見える。なぜか懐かしさと禍々しさを感じる。", "jp_grezzo": "\"谷の奥に街道が見える。なぜか懐かしさと禍々しさを感じる。\"", "en": "You see a pathway near the end of the valley. For some reason, you feel nostalgic and disquieted.", "en_grezzo": "\"You see a pathway near the end of the valley. For some reason, you feel nostalgic and disquieted.\"", "tipo": "statica", "contesto": "", "it": "In fondo alla valle si vede una strada. Si prova nostalgia, e insieme un presagio sinistro."}
